Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set Width 1120
Set Height 720
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type "export PS1='❯ '"
Enter
Type "export PATH=$PWD:$PATH"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "gopro-yank --demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 3s
